Notable judgment call: Unit 3 has no acceptable candidate — every one of the 22 leaves at least one real sentence pair fused (S1/S2, S2/S3, or S3/S4) or severs a sentence unnecessarily at a comma/semicolon that doesn't need splitting. The correct repair needs three breaks (after "compiler.", after "help.", after "Go 1.5."), producing four lines, and the label `_Phase 4a_.` stays attached to the first sentence since it has no verb of its own — none of the given pairwise-break candidates hit that combination, so I rejected all and supplied the repair under `missing`.
